st sit on a parent or guardian's lap. Please note that government mandates\
 
, venue protocols and event requirements are subject to change. Be sure to 
 
visit rockettes.com/faq for the latest information. There is a fourteen (14
 
) ticket limit per purchaser over the entire 2026 Christmas Spectacular sea
 
son. The Christmas Spectacular is an immersive experience that includes con
 
fetti\, pyrotechnics\, smoke effects\, intense lighting\, visual effects\, 
 
loud noises\, flashing lights and flying objects (drones). Such elements ma
 
y aggravate certain medical or physical conditions\, and guests should take
 
